[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[3A\r\u001b[J\r\r\n\u2022 The even-count branch returns only the upper middle value. I'll fix it to average the two middle\r\r\n  values, then run the tests.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\u280b\u001b[0m \u001b[1mEditing\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0mstats.py\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\u2826\u001b[0m \u001b[1mWorking\u001b[0m\u001b[2m (3s \u00b7 esc to interrupt)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u276f \u001b[0m\u001b[2mType a task, / for commands\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m  bypass mode \u00b7 shift+tab to cycle                          16.4k in \u00b7 47% cached \u00b7 413 out \u00b7 $0.001\u001b[0m\u001b[1A\r\u001b[2C\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[4A\r\u001b[J\u001b[32m\u2022 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mEdited\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0mstats.py\r\r\n\u001b[2m  \u2514 \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(+1 -2 lines)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m     11  11 \u001b[0m\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\u001b[2m    ordered = sorted(values)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m     12  12 \u001b[0m\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\u001b[2m    middle = len(ordered) // 2\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m     13  13 \u001b[0m\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\u001b[2m    if len(ordered) % 2:\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m     14     \u001b[0m\u001b[31m- \u001b[0m\u001b[31m        return ordered[middle]\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m     15     \u001b[0m\u001b[31m- \u001b[0m\u001b[31m    return ordered[middle]\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m         14 \u001b[0m\u001b[32m+ \u001b[0m\u001b[32m        return (ordered[middle - 1] + ordered[middle]) / 2\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\u280b\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRunning\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0mpython3 -m unittest -v test_stats 2>&1 | tail -15; git status --short\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\u2826\u001b[0m \u001b[1mWorking\u001b[0m\u001b[2m (3s \u00b7 esc to interrupt)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u276f \u001b[0m\u001b[2mType a task, / for commands\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m  bypass mode \u00b7 shift+tab to cycle                          16.4k in \u00b7 47% cached \u00b7 413 out \u00b7 $0.001\u001b[0m\u001b[1A\r\u001b[2C\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.06, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[5A\r\u001b[J\r\r\n\u001b[32m\u2022 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mRan\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0mpython3 -m unittest -v test_stats 2>&1 | tail -15; git status --short\r\r\n\u001b[2m  \u2514 \u001b[0m\u001b[2m    self.assertEqual(median([4, 1, 3, 2]), 2.5)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m    \u001b[0m\u001b[2mAssertionError: None != 2.5\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m    \u001b[0m\u001b[2m\u2026 +8 lines\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m    \u001b[0m\u001b[2mRan 4 tests in 0.000s\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m    \u001b[0m\u001b[2mFAILED (failures=2)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m    \u001b[0m\u001b[2m M stats.py\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\u2827\u001b[0m \u001b[1mWorking\u001b[0m\u001b[2m (3s \u00b7 esc to interrupt)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u276f \u001b[0m\u001b[2mType a task, / for commands\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m  bypass mode \u00b7 shift+tab to cycle                          16.4k in \u00b7 47% cached \u00b7 413 out \u00b7 $0.001\u001b[0m\u001b[1A\r\u001b[2C\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
